.TITLE{Validation types - CEL - example}

#space#

```go
  applicant := Applicant{
    Email:            "test@example.com",
    PercentagePassed: 50,
  }
```
output:
```txt
  Validation failed:
  - Percentage passed must be 50 < x <= 100
```
.===============================================================================
.TITLE{Validation types - CEL - advanced example}

- OpenAPI v3 + CEL
  - Kubernetes CRD validation
  ```go
  // +kubebuilder:validation:XValidation:rule= \
  //   "!has(self.spec.config.default_path)", \
  //   message="spec.config.default_path is set by ..."
  ```
  ```go
  type TCPService struct {
    Name string `json:"name"`
    // +kubebuilder:validation:Maximum=65535
    // +kubebuilder:validation:Minimum=1
    Port int `json:"port"`
  }
  ```
.===============================================================================
.TITLE{Validation types - CEL - advanced example}

- OpenAPI v3 + CEL
  - Kubernetes CRD validation
  ```go
  // +kubebuilder:validation:Required
  Name     string          `json:"name"`
  ```
  ```go
  // +kubebuilder:validation:Enum=RSA;ECDSA;
  Keytype string `json:"keytype,omitempty"`
  ```
  ```go
  // +kubebuilder:validation:Pattern=`^[^\s]+$`
  ID *string `json:"id,omitempty"`
  ```
